+Equivalently, on `V=A2-B`,
+
+```text
+div(Disc(P_t))=2 I_t
+```
+
+is an index-of-order identity.  It supplies neither normalized ramification
+nor an Orevkov--Chau local-degree correction.  At an ordinary `B` point the
