+| `r_f` | `lambda_f` | `d_f` |
+|---:|---|---:|
+| 1 | `(4)` | `2gamma_f+3` |
+| 2 | `(3,1)` or `(2,2)` | `2gamma_f+4` |
+| 3 | `(2,1,1)` | `2gamma_f+5` |
+| 4 | `(1,1,1,1)` | `2gamma_f+6` |
