+   `N>=2+epsilon_c` in `L1`.
+
+The single cheapest discriminator is
+
+```text
+Theta_h=d_h-r_h-2.                                      (3.13)
+```
+
+Compute `d_h` from the pole order of `h o beta_B` at the one place of `B` at
