+Make the filtration exact by setting `nu(F)=ord_u(F)` and `nu(0)=+infinity`.
+If
+
+```text
+F=h(Z)u^m+O(u^(m+1)),       G=k(Z)u^n+O(u^(n+1)),
+```
+
+then
+
+```text
+nu({F,G}) >= m+n-1,                                      (1.4)
+in_(m+n-1){F,G}
+ =2(m h k'-n h' k)u^(m+n-1).                            (1.5)
+```
